Some awesome global help text!

Command: cmd1 cmd3

This is cmd3

USAGE:
    gleam run -m test cmd1 cmd3 <woo> [ 2 or more arguments ] [ --flag3=<BOOL>
        --global=<STRING> ]

FLAGS:
        --flag3=<BOOL>    This is flag3
        --global=<STRING> This is a global flag
    -h, --help            Print help information
